[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16323.11, "timestamp": "04:32:03", "text": "地方。所以，我不太清楚路。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16325.469, "timestamp": "04:32:05", "text": "我会找到出路"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16329.87, "timestamp": "04:32:09", "text": "不得不跑。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16334.349, "timestamp": "04:32:14", "text": "男生。所以，我穿了一件……呃……全套的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16336.83, "timestamp": "04:32:16", "text": "袖子。是的。一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16342.149, "timestamp": "04:32:22", "text": "卫衣，但是一件长袖连衣裙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16345.349, "timestamp": "04:32:25", "text": "我的天哪。而且不是短裤，而是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16346.269, "timestamp": "04:32:26", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16350.269, "timestamp": "04:32:30", "text": "这叫什么来着？睡衣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16353.83, "timestamp": "04:32:33", "text": "不，如果我在这里，人们会嘲笑我的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16356.51, "timestamp": "04:32:36", "text": "像个布丁一样睡着了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16360.07, "timestamp": "04:32:40", "text": "睡衣。但更像是……你知道的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16362.71, "timestamp": "04:32:42", "text": "短裤之类的，或者类似裤子的那种。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16364.95, "timestamp": "04:32:44", "text": "那种东西。不。呃，你可以这样理解："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16368.389, "timestamp": "04:32:48", "text": "这。呃，比如如果你是那样的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16370.79, "timestamp": "04:32:50", "text": "出去晨练或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16374.229, "timestamp": "04:32:54", "text": "对，就是那个平底锅底部。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16377.87, "timestamp": "04:32:57", "text": "你会说的那个东西，嗯，对，就是那个。"}]